ion.\n50\t\n51\tOut of scope: report computation, the report API, and CSV export (owned by the\n52\treporting backend).\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Given the reporting capability is available, administrators can view\n57\t  per-project GPU-hour consumption reports over selectable time ranges in the\n58\t  Dashboard.\n59\t- Current-month consumption is displayed against each project's Kueue quota for\n60\t  every project with quota or consumption data.\n61\t- The view is not accessible to non-administrator users, verified against the\n62\t  Dashboard's RBAC.\n63\t- The view renders data retrieved from the report retrieval surface without\n64\t  duplicating report computation logic.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-1 (P0): per-project GPU-hour consumption reports over selectable time\n69\t  ranges — administrator viewing portion.\n70\t- HLR-3 (P1, bundled): current-month consumption against each project's Kueue\n71\t  quota — bundled with HLR-1's viewing portion because it renders in the same\n72\t  Dashboard admin view over the same report data; splitting would duplicate the\n73\t  view surface.\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a1e70839a58d64d1","agent_id":"a1d62a9cc75a4342b","session_id":"1ce7f518-86cd-4dc0-977d-8d36a0eb367d","uuid":"abfe5d34-7c9d-4d1a-9aa5-3e170587f8be","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:13:28.044Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab8ffe9cc56db962","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition"}
